usage: niagara_help coverage [-h] [--doc-jars] [--sweep] [module]

positional arguments:
  module      Module name (omit for overview)

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit
  --doc-jars  Gate: every entry of every doc jar of this version must be indexed or excluded with
              a reason (exit 1 on any gap)
  --sweep     Gate: every documentation-like entry of every jar of the whole install (modules/,
              javadoc/, sw/, root) and every file of its docs/ must be indexed or excluded by a
              rule of install_docs.json (exit 1 on any unclassified entry)
